[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525088464","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/8517#issuecomment-525088464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/8517","id":525088464,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNTA4ODQ2NA==","user":{"login":"housseindjirdeh","id":12476932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDc2OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12476932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh","html_url":"https://github.com/housseindjirdeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-08-27T00:47:13Z","updated_at":"2019-08-27T00:47:13Z","body":"Thanks for logging this @damianfrizzi.\r\n\r\nI agree that's most likely the root cause, although I would have not expected that to clear any marks defined in user code (are you setting marks before pages hydrate/boot up?). Regardless, there shouldn't be any reason to clear marks except those that are core-specific, and PR #8527 fixes that  👍 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525088464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525154328","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/8517#issuecomment-525154328","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/8517","id":525154328,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNTE1NDMyOA==","user":{"login":"damianfrizzi","id":5004390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDQzOTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5004390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi","html_url":"https://github.com/damianfrizzi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damianfrizzi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-08-27T06:13:02Z","updated_at":"2019-08-27T06:13:02Z","body":"@housseindjirdeh thank you for the quick fix!\r\n\r\nAs you can see in the repro I'm injecting an inline script into the document head (which in my understanding will be executed before the hydration phase). We need this to track the \"navigationStart\" and to later calculate RUM data. Wouldn't it make sense to expose those marks defined from Next rather than clearing them (an maybe add an unique prefix to them: `__NEXT__navigationStart`)? This would save us some code :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525154328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525787444","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/8517#issuecomment-525787444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/8517","id":525787444,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNTc4NzQ0NA==","user":{"login":"housseindjirdeh","id":12476932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDc2OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12476932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh","html_url":"https://github.com/housseindjirdeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/housseindjirdeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-08-28T15:05:25Z","updated_at":"2019-08-28T15:05:25Z","body":"@damianfrizzi We currently do have a mark in place for when a route change is instantiated ([`routeChange`](https://github.com/zeit/next.js/blob/8c19d78a088ecd343e44d40f496f6d68ffdf05e6/packages/next-server/lib/router/router.ts#L253))\r\n\r\nWe've only begun adding these marks to log specific measures on the performance timeline (time to hydrate begins, hydration time, etc...) which is why we just clear them right after. DIdn't consider that some of these marks might be useful for developers to measure their own specific measures, but that only makes sense! Could you create a separate issue for that? We can most likely remove the clears if it's useful to persist them and prefix them with something like `__NEXT` just like you mentioned :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/525787444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1025408604","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/8517#issuecomment-1025408604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/8517","id":1025408604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis49Hn5c","user":{"login":"balazsorban44","id":18369201,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzY5MjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18369201?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44","html_url":"https://github.com/balazsorban44","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balazsorban44/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-01-31T06:05:59Z","updated_at":"2022-01-31T06:05:59Z","body":"This issue has been automatically